 "ctr_craft_note": "Stand-in Bomb: an octagonal prism along x (the axle it rolls about) from four slabs (0, 90, +-45 degrees), the model's middle (8, 8, 8) is the ball's middle. The fuse leaves the -x cap; the spark is a billboard drawn by the game at the fuse's tip (bomb/bomb_fuse.json), not part of this model."
